WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.756 --> 00:00:13.359
"I have to stop those boulders!"

2
00:00:13.599 --> 00:00:14.319
cried Roxy.

3
00:00:14.959 --> 00:00:17.340
The giant boulders rolled fast toward Metro City.

4
00:00:18.020 --> 00:00:20.641
Roxy fired her eye laser beams at the bottom of the mountain.

5
00:00:22.101 --> 00:00:25.182
Ka-boom! She blasted a huge hole in the ground.

6
00:00:26.903 --> 00:00:28.743
The boulders reached the bottom of the mountain.

7
00:00:30.424 --> 00:00:31.904
Then they rolled right into the hole.

8
00:00:36.512 --> 00:00:37.272
"Yes!" cheered Roxy.

9
00:00:37.813 --> 00:00:39.613
"Now where is that monster?"

10
00:00:42.055 --> 00:00:43.335
Roxy flew over the mountains.

11
00:00:45.836 --> 00:00:47.817
She finally spotted enormous footprints.

12
00:00:49.818 --> 00:00:52.780
She followed the footprints through a valley and around a tall mountain.

13
00:00:53.880 --> 00:00:54.921
Then Roxy stopped.

14
00:00:57.502 --> 00:00:58.902
She heard a deep rumbling sound.

15
00:00:58.922 --> 00:01:01.944
"That sounds like someone snoring!"

16
00:01:04.212 --> 00:01:07.333
She flew over another mountain and saw a field of wildflowers.

17
00:01:08.533 --> 00:01:11.734
The monster lay in the middle of the field, sleeping next to a mansion.

18
00:01:14.515 --> 00:01:15.775
A man stood on the balcony.

19
00:01:17.075 --> 00:01:18.076
He blinked at Roxy.

20
00:01:18.096 --> 00:01:20.256
"You're Rocket Girl, right?"

21
00:01:21.857 --> 00:01:22.517
Roxy nodded.

22
00:01:22.537 --> 00:01:23.497
"Who are you?"

23
00:01:23.517 --> 00:01:26.538
"Professor Newt," said the man.

24
00:01:26.558 --> 00:01:28.559
"I study reptiles.

25
00:01:29.159 --> 00:01:30.079
Why are you here?"

26
00:01:32.460 --> 00:01:33.540
Roxy was confused.

27
00:01:34.636 --> 00:01:36.517
"Do you know this monster?"

28
00:01:36.537 --> 00:01:39.819
"She's not a monster," said Professor Newt.

29
00:01:39.839 --> 00:01:41.960
"She's my pet reptile.

30
00:01:42.460 --> 00:01:43.401
Her name is Bessie."

31
00:01:43.421 --> 00:01:46.142
"Bessie?" Roxy repeated.

32
00:01:46.983 --> 00:01:48.023
Professor Newt nodded.

33
00:01:48.043 --> 00:01:53.366
"My friend gave me a mysterious reptile egg for my birthday.

34
00:01:54.307 --> 00:01:56.348
When the egg hatched, out came Bessie."

35
00:01:57.228 --> 00:01:58.429
He laughed.

36
00:01:59.390 --> 00:02:01.491
"I had no idea she would grow this big!"

37
00:02:02.651 --> 00:02:03.412
Roxy frowned.

38
00:02:04.132 --> 00:02:08.714
"Well, Professor Newt, Bessie almost destroyed Metro City!"

39
00:02:08.734 --> 00:02:11.095
"Oh dear!"

40
00:02:11.375 --> 00:02:12.236
said Professor Newt.

41
00:02:12.896 --> 00:02:14.617
"She must have smelled the flower show."

42
00:02:16.698 --> 00:02:18.058
He looked at the large reptile.

43
00:02:18.078 --> 00:02:21.600
"Bessie loves flowers.

44
00:02:22.680 --> 00:02:24.861
She usually just eats the wildflowers here.

45
00:02:25.622 --> 00:02:27.863
But I guess she wanted to try some new flowers.

46
00:02:29.243 --> 00:02:30.844
How much damage did she do?"

47
00:02:32.116 --> 00:02:34.357
Roxy told Professor Newt what Bessie had done.

48
00:02:36.098 --> 00:02:37.299
The professor gasped.

49
00:02:37.319 --> 00:02:39.340
"Oh no!

50
00:02:39.901 --> 00:02:41.802
I must apologize to Mayor Bloom.

51
00:02:43.002 --> 00:02:46.144
And from now on, I will keep Bessie up here in the mountains.

52
00:02:49.226 --> 00:02:52.228
Bessie is sweet, but she can cause a lot of trouble!"

53
00:02:54.729 --> 00:02:57.991
"Are you still playing Frisbee?"

54
00:02:58.231 --> 00:02:58.892
Roxy called.

55
00:03:00.448 --> 00:03:01.969
She walked into Mara's backyard.

56
00:03:03.249 --> 00:03:04.390
Puddles were everywhere.

57
00:03:05.490 --> 00:03:06.731
Mara and Jack were soaked.

58
00:03:06.751 --> 00:03:08.692
"Nope," said Jack.

59
00:03:08.712 --> 00:03:11.753
"There was a huge monster!"

60
00:03:11.973 --> 00:03:12.513
said Mara.

61
00:03:12.533 --> 00:03:15.754
"And Rocket Girl dumped water on us!"

62
00:03:17.355 --> 00:03:18.095
Roxy grinned.

63
00:03:18.115 --> 00:03:21.777
"Terrell said he wanted to go to the water park!

64
00:03:22.937 --> 00:03:26.539
Where is—" Terrell jumped out from behind a bush.

65
00:03:27.259 --> 00:03:28.600
He was holding a garden hose.

66
00:03:29.460 --> 00:03:32.583
"Gotcha!" he yelled, blasting Roxy with the hose.

67
00:03:32.603 --> 00:03:35.727
"Hey!" Roxy yelped in surprise.

68
00:03:38.450 --> 00:03:40.271
But then she laughed along with her friends.

69
00:03:41.132 --> 00:03:43.875
On such a hot day, the cool water felt great!
